stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Draft
  Draft --> Scheduled: freeze_rules / rule.changed
  Scheduled --> Bidding: start_auction

  Bidding --> Bidding: bid.accepted
  Bidding --> Bidding: anti_snipe_extended / ends_at_ms updated
  Bidding --> Hammered: cap reached
  Bidding --> Cooling: now >= ends_at_ms
  Bidding --> Cancelled: abnormal_cancel

  Cooling --> Hammered: highest bid exists
  Cooling --> Passed: no valid bid
  Cooling --> ReserveNotMet: highest < reserve_cents

  Hammered --> AwaitingSellerConfirm: require_seller_confirm
  Hammered --> Settled: order.created
  AwaitingSellerConfirm --> Settled: seller_confirmed / order.created

  Draft --> Cancelled: cancel
  Scheduled --> Cancelled: cancel

  Passed --> [*]
  ReserveNotMet --> [*]
  Settled --> [*]
  Cancelled --> [*]

  note right of Bidding
    No EXTENDED state.
    Extension is an event while status remains Bidding.
  end note
